"That export was made by a newer version of Keepresso." = "该导出文件由较新版本的 Keepresso 创建。";
"Save current rules as…" = "将当前规则另存为…";
"A recurring notification every interval while a session runs, so a Mac left awake keeps reminding you." = "会话运行期间每隔一段时间发送一次重复通知，让被保持唤醒的 Mac 持续提醒你。";
"A one-time notification once a session has run this long, in case you forget the Mac is awake." = "当会话运行达到此时长时发送一次性通知，以防你忘记 Mac 仍处于唤醒状态。";
"Watch" = "监视";
"Keep awake while downloads are in progress in this folder." = "在此文件夹有下载进行时保持唤醒。";
"Keep Awake" = "保持唤醒";
"Choose a folder on the disk you want to keep spun up." = "在你想让其保持转动的磁盘上选择一个文件夹。";
"Keepresso needs a new approval" = "Keepresso 需要一次新的批准";
"macOS turned Keepresso's background switch off. Turn it back on under Login Items & Extensions in System Settings to keep the password-free helper." = "macOS 关闭了 Keepresso 的后台开关。请在“系统设置”的“登录项与扩展”中重新开启它，以保留免密码助理。";
"Keepresso needs your password" = "Keepresso 需要你的密码";
"Enter your administrator password to switch closed-display mode on for this session." = "输入你的管理员密码，以便在本次会话中开启合盖模式。";
"Enter your administrator password to pause AWDL for this game." = "输入你的管理员密码，以便为此游戏暂停 AWDL。";
"Game detected" = "检测到游戏";
"Pausing AWDL to steady your connection." = "正在暂停 AWDL 以稳定你的连接。";
"AWDL resumed" = "AWDL 已恢复";
"The game closed; AirDrop, Handoff and Continuity are back." = "游戏已关闭；AirDrop、Handoff 和连续互通已恢复。";
"This copy of Keepresso isn't in the Applications folder, so it leaves the helper alone. Install from /Applications." = "此 Keepresso 副本不在“应用程序”文件夹中，因此不会改动助理。请从 /Applications 安装。";
"The helper wasn't found inside the app. Reinstall Keepresso and try again." = "在 App 内未找到助理。请重新安装 Keepresso 后重试。";
"The helper couldn't be registered." = "无法注册助理。";
"The helper couldn't be removed: %@" = "无法移除助理：%@";
"macOS still reports the helper as registered. Try again, or restart the Mac." = "macOS 仍报告助理已注册。请重试，或重新启动 Mac。";
"Removed. System Settings may keep showing Keepresso under App Background Activity until macOS refreshes its list; restarting the Mac clears the leftover row." = "已移除。在 macOS 刷新其列表之前，“系统设置”可能仍在“App 后台活动”中显示 Keepresso；重新启动 Mac 可清除残留的条目。";
"macOS is refusing the helper's registration outright. Reinstall the helper; if that doesn't take, restart the Mac and try once more." = "macOS 直接拒绝了助理的注册。请重新安装助理；若仍无效，请重新启动 Mac 后再试一次。";
"The helper isn't responding. If an old copy of Keepresso is in the Trash, empty the Trash first: macOS keeps disabling the helper while one is there. Then reinstall the helper." = "助理无响应。如果废纸篓中有旧的 Keepresso 副本，请先清倒废纸篓：只要还有一个，macOS 就会持续停用助理。然后重新安装助理。";
"Old copy stuck in the Trash" = "废纸篓中卡着旧副本";
"An old copy of Keepresso in the Trash keeps the background helper from working. Please delete it from the Trash, or empty the Trash." = "废纸篓中的旧 Keepresso 副本会导致后台助理无法工作。请从废纸篓中删除它，或清倒废纸篓。";
