"Keeps the Mac awake while a coding-agent session (claude, codex, gemini, aider, and the like) is actively working, judged by its CPU use, and lets it sleep once every session has gone idle for the grace period. The menu lists each detected session. A freshly started session can take a few seconds to read as working." = "在编码代理会话（claude、codex、gemini、aider 等）根据其 CPU 使用情况判断为正在实际工作时保持 Mac 唤醒，并在所有会话空闲满宽限期后允许 Mac 睡眠。菜单会列出检测到的每个会话。刚启动的会话可能需要几秒钟才会显示为工作中。";
