"Claude Code connected: sessions report working and waiting exactly." = "已连接 Claude Code：会话可精确报告工作与等待状态。";
"Connect Claude Code for exact session tracking (adds hooks to its settings)." = "连接 Claude Code 以精确跟踪会话（将在其设置中添加钩子）。";
